<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi officials say external parties are using Iraqi territory to launch attacks on neighbours while the foreign minister discusses militia weapons regulation with Tehran and regional security arrangements free of outside interference. Flash floods have killed one person, left a child missing in Erbil and caused five deaths and flooding in Kirkuk and the Kurdistan Region, while protests blocked the Mosul-Erbil road in the Nineveh Plains and smuggling of petroleum products was foiled in Diyala and Nineveh. Turkey is supporting Iraqi counter-ISIS operations in Kirkuk and reinforcing border posts, and the U.S. Embassy warned citizens of security risks. The UCDP recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiREFVX3lxTE1jVTREcTE1N0QwckFLU3EtY1QtUmNOM0EzdFZBb3EyZVRrZlJ0TmFxSW5CaFE0dTdJNU9PbUJSMUhMbEF1?oc=5&quot;&gt;964media&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZEFVX3lxTE00b09teDhGWmhodDlfakhiRXdFUEJhWWdQa2VXUmQ3UDlDOU1ZWkxvUXB5Z3h0THNLOXdZTWxmbWlxOVFMb1ZSWTZRdjJCRF9weEVtZU5rZ0tDdWRVcENYdnZsU2o?oc=5&quot;&gt;Rudaw&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxQaXN5SWhNVFlOTjhia3dsNG91aEdPUjE1ZEpiWmRxZVZJYm0zU0VRS25UOEhKZHJ3eFZFV0dkMmkxdVYyVW9oVThzR05zc3FBQTRBNElWa3ZHME16VE54UlpCVlNsSmdRMkpNUUVCWUJCcURLLWRuZGxOaDNDOW50ZHUxRm9hWktoRE9qMUlrWGtNRFZxbFZnVUpMdXF4dXBTQ2VRZ015S0UwX0VlZnRHNXVkSUJIVEJmUzBhVnFVTkJvUnRv?oc=5&quot;&gt;Middle East Eye&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxNRDRRMXJFVW1yMV9UeXgybTlUWjdyZlBjNGowNmFQTmhZb1dTeE1XV3hPV3BhZlcwckRIcFk5bFNRZl9Jd1QwYWJRS09VZVdFSXVyaWxYM0kxY2VZNFA